# thoughts/ split commit policy (per ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md)
# - thoughts/<username>/  — per-person scratchpad, GIT-IGNORED
# - thoughts/shared/       — research/plans/handoffs/prs, COMMITTED
# - thoughts/searchable/   — hard links for searching, GIT-IGNORED
